cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Car Damage Mask R-CNN (R-101-DC5)"
message: "If you use this model or code, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The car-damage-maskrcnn authors"
abstract: >-
  Instance segmentation of seven kinds of physical damage on cars, for
  insurance, rental and resale inspection. Mask R-CNN with a ResNet-101
  Dilated-C5 backbone, trained with Detectron2 v0.6. Released as an
  intermediate checkpoint at iteration 59,999 of 270,000 scheduled.
keywords:
  - car-damage
  - instance-segmentation
  - mask-rcnn
  - detectron2
  - vehicle-inspection
  - computer-vision
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
